<div class="WordSection1">
<div class="WordSection1">Thanks for getting in touch.<br />
<br />
As an international account customer, you can collect imported goods for a third party following this simple, two-step process online:&nbsp;<br />
<br />
1. Complete the Payment &amp; Collection Authority (PCA) online form by selecting ‘Create/Manage PCA’. If this function is not in your profile – please email your username to freight@qantas.com.au requesting to have the PCA function added.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
2. Have your customer approve the nominate agent through a link sent to their email.<br />
<br />
<br />
Once this is done, our system will automatically pair you with the designated air waybill (AWB).<br />
<br />
Details needed:<br />
<br />
• AWB number<br />
• AWB origin and destination<br />
• Consignee email address
<div class="WordSection1">
